#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:4
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "快速上手"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page describes a first federated training run with fl-sim: install the package, train :class:`~fl_sim.algorithms.fedopt.FedAvg` on a synthetic dataset, and inspect the logs it produces. The run"
" completes in seconds on a laptop and requires neither a dataset download nor a GPU."
msgstr "本页面介绍 fl-sim 上第一次联邦训练的完整流程：安装本包，在合成数据集上训练 :class:`~fl_sim.algorithms.fedopt.FedAvg`，并查看其产出的日志。整个运行在笔记本电脑上数秒内即可完成，既不需要下载数据集，也不需要 GPU。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:11
msgid "The core concepts are described in :doc:`concepts`; readers who prefer a conceptual overview first may start there."
msgstr "核心概念见 :doc:`concepts` ；希望先了解概念的读者可从该页开始。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:15
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "准备条件"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:17
msgid "Install fl-sim following :doc:`install` (``pip install git+https://github.com/wenh06/fl-sim.git``). Python 3.10+ with PyTorch is required."
msgstr "按照 :doc:`install` 安装 fl-sim（``pip install git+https://github.com/wenh06/fl-sim.git``）。需要 Python 3.10+ 与 PyTorch。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:21
msgid "Train your first model"
msgstr "训练第一个模型"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:23
msgid ""
"Every federated run in fl-sim is built from three objects: a **dataset** (the data plus how it is split across clients), a **model** (a PyTorch module, here taken from the dataset's built-in "
"candidates), and a **server** (which owns the global model, samples clients, and aggregates). The server config carries the federated schedule (rounds, client count, sampling ratio); the client "
"config carries the local training recipe."
msgstr "fl-sim 中的每次联邦训练都由三个对象构成： **数据集** （数据本身以及在客户端之间的划分方式）、 **模型** （一个 PyTorch 模块，这里取自数据集内置的候选模型）和 **服务器** （持有全局模型，负责采样客户端与聚合）。服务器配置承载联邦训练的调度（轮数、客户端数量、采样比例）；客户端配置承载本地训练方案。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:35
msgid ""
"The code runs as a script or in a REPL. ``FedSynthetic`` generates a synthetic classification dataset split across 30 clients; nothing is downloaded. ``FedAvgServerConfig(num_iters=5, "
"num_clients=10, clients_sample_ratio=1.0)`` runs **5 rounds**, each sampling **10 of the 30 clients** with all of them responding. ``server.train()`` executes the full federated loop; per-round "
"progress and metrics are printed to the console."
msgstr ""
"上述代码可作为脚本运行，也可在 REPL 中执行。 ``FedSynthetic`` 在本地生成划分给 30 个客户端的合成分类数据集，不执行任何下载。 ``FedAvgServerConfig(num_iters=5, num_clients=10, clients_sample_ratio=1.0)`` 运行 **5 轮**，每轮从 30 个客户端中采样 **10 个**，且全部响应。 "
"``server.train()`` 执行完整的联邦循环；每轮的进度与指标将打印到控制台。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:44
msgid "``server.train()`` is ``server.train(\"federated\")``. fl-sim can also run ``\"centralized\"`` and ``\"local\"`` baselines with the same objects — see the :meth:`~fl_sim.nodes.Server.train` API."
msgstr "``server.train()`` 即 ``server.train(\"federated\")``。fl-sim 也可以用同样的对象运行 ``\"centralized\"`` 与 ``\"local\"`` 基线——参见 :meth:`~fl_sim.nodes.Server.train` API。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:49
msgid "Log files"
msgstr "日志文件"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:51
msgid ""
"Every run writes its logs to ``~/.cache/fl-sim/.logs/`` (the subdirectory can be overridden with ``log_dir=`` in the server config, as done here). The script above reads the metrics back and prints "
"the result:"
msgstr "每次运行的日志写入 ``~/.cache/fl-sim/.logs/``（子目录可经服务器配置中的 ``log_dir=`` 覆盖，如本例所示）。上述脚本读回指标并打印结果："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:62
msgid "Three files per run:"
msgstr "每次运行产生三个文件："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:64
msgid "a ``.txt`` log with the human-readable console history;"
msgstr "一个 ``.txt`` 日志，保存人类可读的控制台历史；"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:65
msgid ""
"a ``.json`` log with the full metrics history, structured as ``{\"train\": {...}, \"val\": {\"Server\": [...], \"Client0\": [...], ...}}`` — one dict per evaluation, holding ``step``, ``acc``, "
"``loss``, etc. This file is the input for visualization;"
msgstr "一个 ``.json`` 日志，保存完整的指标历史，结构为 ``{\"train\": {...}, \"val\": {\"Server\": [...], \"Client0\": [...], ...}}``——每次评估对应一个字典，包含 ``step``、``acc``、``loss`` 等字段。该文件是可视化所用的输入；"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:69
msgid "``config.json`` — the exact server and client configs of the run, so every experiment can be reproduced later."
msgstr "``config.json``——本次运行的确切服务器与客户端配置，便于日后复现每个实验。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:74
msgid ""
"The ``step`` in the logs counts **communications**, not rounds: each round adds one downlink broadcast plus one uplink reply per sampled client (10 sampled clients → step advances by 20 per round "
"here). The json snapshot is taken at the start of each round, so the final communication count is higher than the last logged step."
msgstr "日志中的 ``step`` 统计的是**通信次数**，而不是轮数：每轮对每个被采样客户端包含一次下行广播与一次上行回复（这里每轮采样 10 个客户端，因此 step 每轮前进 20）。json 中的快照记录于每轮开始时，因此最终通信次数会大于最后一条日志的 step。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:80
msgid "(The exact accuracy value may differ across machines and package versions; on one machine this run ends at 0.8767, up from 0.011 — chance level for 10 classes — at initialization.)"
msgstr "（具体精度数值可能因机器与包版本而异；在一种机器上，该运行的最终精度为 0.8767，初始时为 0.011——即 10 类任务的随机水平。）"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:85
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "下一步"

