msgid ":doc:`concepts` — what actually happens in each round: sampling, broadcast, local updates, aggregation."
msgstr ":doc:`concepts`——每一轮实际发生了什么：采样、广播、本地更新、聚合。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:89
msgid ":doc:`tutorial-first-experiment` — turn this single run into a controlled comparison across algorithms and sampling ratios."
msgstr ":doc:`tutorial-first-experiment`——把这个单次运行变成跨算法、跨采样比例的对照实验。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:91
msgid ":doc:`tutorial-cli-matrix` — run experiment batches from the CLI with YAML config files."
msgstr ":doc:`tutorial-cli-matrix`——用 YAML 配置文件从命令行跑实验批次。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:93
msgid ":doc:`parallel_execution` — accelerate training with a parallel executor backend while keeping results reproducible."
msgstr ":doc:`parallel_execution`——用并行执行后端加速训练，同时保持结果可复现。"

